
# 2026-09-27 14:43:22.450792
+Build ALL 4 mobile-first React (Vite) apps exactly per frontend-BRIEF.md which is in your context. Apps live in apps/seller, apps/mart, apps/partner, apps/admin.
+
+Order of work:
+1. Scaffold each app with Vite + React (npm create vite@latest style structure, hand-write files, no interactive prompts).
+2. Implement EVERY screen and feature listed in the brief for each app. Wire every screen to the real backend API. API base from env VITE_API_URL defaulting to http://localhost:3000. Auth: Firebase Google sign-in, then POST /api/auth/verify {idToken}, then Authorization: Bearer <idToken> header on all calls (axios instance).
+3. Copy needed logo assets from /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/ into each app public/ folder (icon, horizontal logos, favicon).
+4. No lorem ipsum, no mock data, no placeholder screens — everything functional against the API. Graceful error toasts, loading states, mobile-first CSS.
+5. After all code is written: run npm install then npm run build in EACH of the 4 apps. Fix ALL build errors. Keep iterating until all 4 apps compile cleanly.
+
+Do not stop to ask questions — make reasonable decisions and continue until all 4 apps build successfully.

