# 2026-09-27 14:59:29.260749
+Build ONLY the seller app in apps/seller (Vite + React). Follow frontend-BRIEF.md section 1 (seller) exactly.
+
+Steps:
+1. Scaffold apps/seller as Vite + React app (package.json, vite.config.js, index.html, src/main.jsx, src/App.jsx). Install deps: react, react-dom, react-router-dom, axios, firebase.
+2. Implement: Firebase Google login -> POST /api/auth/verify -> role seller. Shop create/manage (name, address, GPS lat/lng, open/close toggle). Product add with 3 tabs: AI Scan (photo upload -> POST /api/scan/ai multipart -> auto-fill name/category/description), Barcode (input -> POST /api/scan/barcode -> auto-fill), Manual form. Product list/edit/delete. Orders list with Accept -> Pack status flow (PATCH /api/orders/:id/status).
+3. Shared: src/api.js (axios instance, VITE_API_URL default http://localhost:3000, Bearer token), src/AuthContext.jsx, mobile-first CSS in src/styles.css.
+4. Copy logos from /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/ to apps/seller/public/ (icon as app icon, horizontal-dark logo in header, favicon.png as favicon).
+5. Run npm install and npm run build inside apps/seller. Fix ALL build errors until it compiles cleanly.
+
+Work in small steps, saving files as you go. Do not stop to ask questions.

