# 2026-09-27 15:56:15.364830
+Fix 7 QA bugs in apps/seller (Vite + React). QA report with exact file:line references:
+
+1. CRITICAL — src/AuthContext.jsx:19: verify call sends only { idToken }. Backend defaults new users to role 'customer', so first-time sellers get locked out by ProtectedRoute ('Seller access only' wall). Fix: send { idToken, role: 'seller' } in the verify call.
+
+2. CRITICAL — src/pages/Dashboard.jsx:25-26, Orders.jsx:31-33, Products.jsx:17-19, ProductForm.jsx:49-51, Shop.jsx:20-22: all fetch GET /shops and take shops[0], which is the globally newest shop, NOT the seller's own (data leak + wrong shop_id on product creation -> backend 403). Fix: use api.get('/shops?mine=true') in all five places (backend supports ?mine=true).
+
+3. CRITICAL — src/pages/Products.jsx:22, Dashboard.jsx:29 (count), ProductForm.jsx:54 (edit): GET /products without ?shop_id= shows ALL sellers' products including competitors' Edit buttons. Fix: api.get('/products', { params: { shop_id: shopId } }) using the seller's own shop id (backend supports ?shop_id= filter).
+
+4. MEDIUM — src/pages/Orders.jsx: backend supports 'cancelled' status but UI has no cancel action, no 'cancelled' filter option, and any terminal state not in NEXT_STATUS renders as green '✓ Packed' badge (a cancelled order would show as Packed — wrong). Fix: add a cancel-order button, add 'cancelled' to the status filter, and render correct badges for terminal states.
+
+5. MEDIUM — add a visible 'Payment coming soon' badge on the Orders page near order totals. Locked beta rule: payment is coming soon. Currently zero mentions of payment in src/.
+
+6. MEDIUM — src/pages/Shop.jsx:85-86: form submits with null lat/lng when GPS not set -> backend 400 with raw error toast. Fix: validate lat/lng are valid numbers before submit; block with a friendly message if GPS location is missing.
+
+7. MEDIUM — brand assets missing: src/pages/Login.jsx:48 references /logo-dark.png, index.html:5-6 reference /favicon.png and /logo-icon.png, but apps/seller/public/ has only README.txt (404s on fresh build). Fix: copy from /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/ into apps/seller/public/: lezzflow-horizontal-dark.png -> logo-dark.png, lezzflow-icon.png -> logo-icon.png, favicon.png -> favicon.png.
+
+Then run npm run build inside apps/seller and fix ALL build errors until it compiles cleanly. Work in small steps, saving files as you go. Do not stop to ask questions.

