# 2026-09-27 15:57:57.698209
+You MUST edit files with your edit tool — real edits, not summaries. You CAN run shell commands. 6 QA bugs in this Vite+React app:
+
+1. src/pages/ShopDetail.jsx: when shop.is_open === false, only a 'Closed' chip shows but Add buttons stay active. Fix: disable all Add-to-cart buttons when the shop is closed, with a 'Shop is closed' hint.
+
+2. src/pages/Checkout.jsx lines 49-53: items payload has only {product_id, quantity, price} so Orders page renders 'Item 1 x 2'. Fix: include each product's name in the item payload: {product_id, name, quantity, price}.
+
+3. Brand assets missing: there is no public/ directory, but src/pages/Login.jsx:24 references /lezzflow-icon.png, src/App.jsx:48 references a footer icon, index.html:6 references /favicon.png. Fix: mkdir -p public and run: cp /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/lezzflow-icon.png public/lezzflow-icon.png; cp /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/favicon.png public/favicon.png. Also add onError fallbacks on the img tags so a missing asset never shows a broken icon.
+
+4. src/App.jsx lines 17-21: non-customer roles only get a warning banner but can still reach checkout -> 403 from POST /api/orders. Fix: hard-block — redirect non-customer logged-in users away from shop/checkout routes (same pattern as a ProtectedRoute that requires role 'customer').
+
+5. src/AuthContext.jsx line 22: verify POST sends only { idToken }. Fix: send { idToken, role: 'customer' }.
+
+6. UX: src/pages/Home.jsx — when the user denies GPS, the map sticks to the Bengaluru default and no shops load with no manual fallback. Fix: if geolocation fails/denied, show a 'Set location manually' option (map click-to-set or a retry button), so the user is never stuck.
+
+After ALL edits, run npm run build here and fix any build errors until clean. Then list every file you changed.

