# 2026-09-27 16:00:28.040753
+ONE-SHOT MODE: one turn, apply the edit with your edit tool now, no narration. Bug: db/index.js createMemPool() hardcodes only migrations/001_initial_schema.sql, so new migration 002_add_order_address.sql never loads in tests -> INSERT with address column fails with 500.
+
+Fix: in createMemPool(), replace the hardcoded single-file load with a loop over ALL .sql files in the migrations dir sorted alphabetically (same convention as db/migrate.js): read the dir with fs.readdirSync, filter .sql, sort, and run each file's SQL via memDb.public.none(sql).
+
+After the edit run npm test. All 104 tests must pass. End with the list of files changed.

