# 2026-09-27 16:20:45.214694
+Build ONLY the admin app in apps/admin (Vite + React). Follow frontend-BRIEF.md section 4 (admin) exactly.
+
+Steps:
+1. Scaffold apps/admin as Vite + React app (package.json, vite.config.js, index.html, src/main.jsx, src/App.jsx). Install deps: react, react-dom, react-router-dom, axios, firebase.
+2. Implement against the REAL backend admin endpoints (READ routes/adminRoutes.js and controllers/adminController.js first):
+   - Firebase Google login -> POST /api/auth/verify with { idToken, role: 'admin' }
+   - Hard role block: logged-in user whose role is not 'admin' sees an access-denied screen with sign-out (do NOT redirect, all routes are protected)
+   - Dashboard: GET /api/admin/stats (platform overview cards)
+   - Shops: GET /api/admin/shops?search=
+   - Orders: GET /api/admin/orders?status=
+   - Users: GET /api/admin/users?role=
+   - Products: GET /api/admin/products?shopId=
+   - KYC review: pending list + approve/reject (match kycRoutes.js admin endpoints exactly)
+   - NEVER display document URLs or full Aadhaar/PAN/licence numbers — mask everything, show only 'Document on file' labels
+3. Shared: src/api.js (axios, VITE_API_URL default http://localhost:3000, Bearer token), src/AuthContext.jsx, clean desktop-first CSS with sidebar nav, loading/error/empty states on every page.
+4. Copy logos from /home/hatch/workspace/lezzflow-logos/ to apps/admin/public/ (use lezzflow-icon.png as logo-icon, favicon.png, lezzflow-horizontal-dark.png as logo). Reference /favicon.png in index.html.
+5. Run npm install and npm run build inside apps/admin. Fix ALL build errors until it compiles cleanly.
+
+Work in small steps, saving files as you go. Do not stop to ask questions.

